<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - McDonalds cut at Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - McDonalds cut at Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said Thursday it cut its intermediate rating of McDonald's Corp to accumulate from buy, but kept the fast food restaurant chain as a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed Wednesday at 48-1/16.</p>
</text>
